# research and build scratch
#
# `.tmp-geo/` holds the Census boundary file the map generator reads (1.5MB of
# public-domain geometry that `scripts/generate-us-map.ts` turns into the committed
# `src/content/geo/us-states.ts`).
#
# `.tmp-research/` holds downloaded official fee schedules and their text
# extractions. Those are public documents and the *transcription* is committed under
# `research/`, with its source URL and hash; the downloads themselves change without
# notice and should not sit in the repository as if they were a frozen artefact.
.tmp-geo/
.tmp-research/
.tmp-*/

